### 팀 역할 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 멤버에게 부여된 역할 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/members/1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 팀 역할 생성
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cowork",
  "colorHex": "#5865F2",
  "priority": 0,
  "mentionable": false,
  "permissions": [
    "MANAGE_CHANNELS",
    "MENTION_EVERYONE"
  ]
}

### 팀 역할 수정
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "cowork",
  "colorHex": "#5865F2"
}

### 팀 역할 삭제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 멤버에게 역할 부여
PUT {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/members/1/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 멤버의 역할 회수
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/{{teamId}}/members/1/roles/1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
